OL,3,GNEWSAMoD fears new housing could
OL,4,Aundermine SAS base
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposal to build up to 250 houses
OL,7,Fnext to the national headquarters of
OL,8,Fthe SAS could undermine security at the
OL,9,Fbase, the Ministry of Defence (MoD) has
OL,10,Fwarned.
OL,12,FThe new housing estate, more than a
OL,13,Fthird of them affordable, could be
OL,14,Fbuilt on a 26-acre field opposite
OL,15,FStirling Lines, an Army garrison in
OL,16,FCredenhill, Herefordshire.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
