OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1788425747
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMoD fears new housing could
OL,4,Aundermine SAS base
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis "is an operational defence site of
OL,7,Fnational importance", the MoD said in a
OL,8,Fletter setting out its concerns, adding
OL,9,Fthe proposed scheme would mark a
OL,10,F"significant cumulative increase" in
OL,11,Fproperties next to it.
OL,13,FWhile the current proposal was for
OL,14,Foutline permission only, the MoD said
OL,15,Fit should have a say before any final
OL,16,Flayout of the scheme is approved.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
